    {
      "question": "Factorise completely: x^2 - 49",
      "options": [
        "(x + 7)(x + 7)",
        "(x - 7)(x - 7)",
        "(x + 7)(x - 7)",
        "(x + 49)(x - 1)"
      ],
      "correct": 2,
      "points": 10,
      "explanation": "Using the difference of two squares: a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b). Here, x^2 - 49 = x^2 - 7^2 = (x + 7)(x - 7)"
    },
    {
      "question": "Factorise completely: 25a^2 - 16b^2",
      "options": [
        "(5a + 4b)(5a + 4b)",
        "(5a - 4b)(5a - 4b)",
        "(5a + 4b)(5a - 4b)",
        "(25a + 16b)(a - b)"
      ],
      "correct": 2,
      "points": 10,
      "explanation": "Using a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b). Here, 25a^2 - 16b^2 = (5a)^2 - (4b)^2 = (5a + 4b)(5a - 4b)"
    },
    {
      "question": "Expand: (√x + 1)(√x - 1)",
      "options": [
        "x - 1",
        "x + 1",
        "x^2 - 1",
        "√x - 1"
      ],
      "correct": 0,
      "points": 12,
      "explanation": "Using (a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2. Here, a = √x and b = 1. So (√x + 1)(√x - 1) = (√x)^2 - 1^2 = x - 1"
    },
    {
      "question": "Factorise completely: 81 - y^2",
      "options": [
        "(81 + y)(1 - y)",
        "(9 + y)(9 + y)",
